{"c":[{"name":"20261009T133022Z-c6da35b2ee65e6ca","text":"Reader typed-value kinds have a helper-side correction: fill/kinds.ts readerValue retypes a bare digit run on a loyalty/membership line from phone to id; TypedValues.swift membershipNumber applies the same word lists. Change both together.","type":"note"},{"name":"20261009T133022Z-f6d432411519e4b6","text":"VERIFY_CUTOFF (fill/contract.ts) stays 0.75 by the Oct 9 sweep: lowering it needs ~100 labelled wrong verifier answers in the new band; W2's dev-set run had only 32 between 0.65 and 0.75.","type":"note"}]}
